  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fa0a55ce453d074",
      "translationZh": "我对不同版本的 Qwen 3.8 27B 做了几次测试，主要测试的是 IQ4_XS，因为它能装进我的显卡。还测试了一些其他模型作为对比。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05b6bf0ace67de33",
      "translationZh": "创建一个单文件 Three.js 动画：一朵青绿色与金色相间的机械花围绕发光的核心展开，然后无缝闭合。采用电影级灯光，齿轮清晰可见，摄像机环绕拍摄，不要文字。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa42f5fb9b8994a4",
      "translationZh": "这是一项从前沿模型测试中选取的高难度任务，即便这些模型的表现也不完美。没有模型拿到 5/5 分，这也在意料之中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9918d584cccaf9f",
      "translationZh": "这是一个简单的 Tauri+Yew 桌面应用，预期用于显示一个富文本编辑器。编辑器应该做成一个组件，以便在其他应用中复用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c7044d86eb9d5d9",
      "translationZh": "<i></i>：斜体文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b9b1d77095da044d",
      "translationZh": "<span style=\"color: #FFAA41;\"></span>：文本颜色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02f67363c43e0242",
      "translationZh": "<sub></sub>：下标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
