      "sourceHash": "67c2f1e3d2a58a0d",
      "translationZh": "`<pre><code></code></pre>`：代码块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9fba99479fbb707",
      "translationZh": "`<blockquote></blockquote>`：引用块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f89806fca6bc5963",
      "translationZh": "`<a href=\"https://\"></a>`：链接，提示输入链接地址和链接文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff0e365ec4c188ea",
      "translationZh": "处理 ` `、`<`、`>`",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e5b3cafccb5b0dc",
      "translationZh": "应该可以组合两种或更多种格式，例如红色粗体文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10d70d92bd9389c6",
      "translationZh": "两种模式下都应该可以编辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39f1f1a745bf154a",
      "translationZh": "给我 20 个由 3 个字母组成的波兰语单词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2271508aaa8b5b11",
      "translationZh": "挺有意思，不过有些模型确实会卡在这一项上。我怀疑是量化相关的问题。那么我会保留这项测试，用来测试不同的量化版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c7d57858270c0f9",
      "translationZh": "在测试 1 中，GSQ-RCO IQ3_S 和 Byteshape 版本表现最好，不过两者在正确呈现闪电方面都有问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62a738394f013b07",
      "translationZh": "Twin Turbo 把齿轮搞砸了，但花瓣比 Unsloth 做得更好，而 Unsloth 可以凭借阴影效果获得额外加分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "014687aee3f7f3c3",
      "translationZh": "Cold Fusion 彻底搞砸了，Nex N2 Mini (APEX Quality) 也完全搞砸了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f6b504d762923c3",
      "translationZh": "Swift 模型确实给出了接近 Unsloth 的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8720fd672a925a3d",
      "translationZh": "测试 2，是一项耗时较长的复杂任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ccf7e17b573cba4",
      "translationZh": "Unsloth 似乎最可靠，在一小时内给出了可用的解决方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a32fe502d5c2c339",
      "translationZh": "Twin Turbo 用 15 分钟就完成了，但有一些小缺陷，又花了 10 分钟才解决，所以它也值得推荐。可能需要一份更详细的 agents 文件，描述测试之类的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a6ef1b1cabfd8c7",
      "translationZh": "我还让它给 WYSIWYG 模式添加行号，这又花了 25 分钟，还需要额外的提示，因为这有些复杂。需要考虑不同的字体大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8282fb1cd7a170f4",
      "translationZh": "Swift 模型花了几个小时，无缘无故停了好几次，但还是完成了，虽然有一些小 bug，不过它修复了这些问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4875f81e7475c655",
      "translationZh": "GSQ-RCO 完成了任务，但花了 5h，中途停了一次，不过和 swift 一样，我只需要告诉它“继续”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5e457142dfc2940",
      "translationZh": "Nex N2 Mini：基本功能存在严重问题，不推荐",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6cb75ba965f0723f",
      "translationZh": "Byteshape：工作 4h 后有一些小问题，但它修复了这些问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bcd524d5c2e34729",
      "translationZh": "HauhauCS Aggressive：几个小时后出现了颜色选择器问题，但它能完成任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65b13881adecb500",
      "translationZh": "测试 3 来自 Reddit，令人意外的是，Unsloth 在这里表现很差：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f62f8250c8abc25",
      "translationZh": "Unsloth：陷入了重复 1 个词的循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63ef8bcbff7961be",
      "translationZh": "Twin Turbo：要跑上一阵子，但能给出结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a4d9d73eb120d8d",
      "translationZh": "Byteshape：很快就能给出像样的结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c9e0e74329cb477",
      "translationZh": "Gemma4 12B Q5_K_M：立刻给出结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff8535133726f3e2",
      "translationZh": "Swift 模型的显存占用明显高于其他 IQ4_XS 版本，在 7900XT 上只能支持 128k 的上下文窗口，因此我只会考虑在 24GB 显卡上使用它的 Q4_K_M 版本。其他版本都能轻松支持至少约 150k 的上下文窗口。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "341f3f7e0e9b9c4a",
      "translationZh": "在 16GB 显卡上，GSQ-RCO 看起来是这里的赢家，Byteshape 也紧随其后。两者完成任务都需要更多时间，这可以视为一种代价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a8ce41bd46032dd",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Mordimer86 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
